{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>走在街上聽到動人旋律卻想不起歌名，或在咖啡廳被音樂環繞卻不好意思詢問？SongDetect 正是為解決這些瞬間而生的音樂識別工具。這款應用程序目前正進行限時免費活動，讓用戶能輕鬆捕捉身邊的美妙聲音，不再錯過任何心動的時刻。</p>\n\n<h2>一鍵快速辨識歌曲</h2>\n<p>只需開啟 App 並點擊中央按鈕，即可在約 3 秒內精準辨識周圍播放的流行金曲、經典老歌或獨立音樂。辨識成功後支援立即播放以重温情感，並自動保存記錄與創建個人播放列表。其介面設計優雅簡潔，操作直觀易上手，更支援一鍵跳轉至 Apple Music 探索相關專輯及分享給朋友，讓音樂發現之旅充滿樂趣。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1293-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1294-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1295-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1296-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1297-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：SongDetect – Music Recognition</li>\n<li>應用類別：Music</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T07:58:19.096871+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":331,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}